Turbo AI Chat

This project includes a staged HarmonyOS arm64 MNN runtime binary and minimal
MNN headers for demo build convenience. MNN is developed by Alibaba and is
licensed under the Apache License 2.0. See https://github.com/alibaba/MNN.

The recommended built-in MNN model weights are not included in this repository.
Download them from ModelScope:
https://modelscope.cn/models/MNN/gemma-4-E2B-it-MNN
https://modelscope.cn/models/MNN/MiniCPM5-1B-MNN
